# Each app reads its own env file:
#
#   apps/tutor-web/.env.local         ← copy apps/tutor-web/.env.example
#   apps/tutor-functions/.secret.local  (emulator secrets, e.g. GEMINI_API_KEY=...)
#
# Deployed function secrets are set with:
#   npx firebase functions:secrets:set GEMINI_API_KEY
#
# Postgres, Redis and S3 settings return when those services are added.
